        {
          "segment_id": "title",
          "type": "title",
          "source_text": "送给你了",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-19-you-can-have-it_title_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:001",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "地上的用纸巾捡一下就行。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-19-you-can-have-it_dialogue_001_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "001",
          "speaker": "母亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:002",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "现在想喝茶都不行了。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-19-you-can-have-it_dialogue_002_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "002",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:003",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "又要出钱买一个新杯子。哦，厨房还有一个杯子，学校发的生日礼物！",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-19-you-can-have-it_dialogue_003_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "003",
          "speaker": "母亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:004",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "看一下。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-19-you-can-have-it_dialogue_004_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "004",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:005",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "在消毒柜下面。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-19-you-can-have-it_dialogue_005_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "005",
          "speaker": "母亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:006",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "这个好看点。能送给我吗？不然我新买一个算了。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-19-you-can-have-it_dialogue_006_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "006",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:007",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "不用，送给你了。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-19-you-can-have-it_dialogue_007_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "007",
          "speaker": "孩子"
        }
      ]
    },
